Portions adapted from Tongyi DeepResearch, Copyright Alibaba-NLP/Tongyi Lab,
Apache-2.0.
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

The deep web research engine (SIG-298, src/do/deep-research/) adapts the
research-loop structure and several prompt/extraction patterns from the
Apache-2.0 "Tongyi DeepResearch" project. The prompts were re-tuned for
Sigilix's code-review / repo-improvement research assistant and are collected in
src/do/deep-research/prompts.ts. Adapted (not verbatim-copied) material and its
Tongyi sources:

  - Goal-conditioned page extraction prompt (buildExtractionPrompt)
      ← WebAgent/NestBrowse/prompts.py
        (SUMMARY_PROMPT / SYSTEM_PROMPT_SUMMARY_OURS — rationale/evidence/
        summary extraction framing)

  - Planning and query-generation prompts (buildPlanPrompt / buildQueryPrompt)
    and the overall multi-round search → read → synthesize loop structure
      ← WebAgent/WebWeaver/prompt/search_sys_prompt_2.py
        (SEARCH_SYSTEM_PROMPT — persistent information-seeking / decompose-into-
        facets framing)
      ← WebAgent/NestBrowse/prompts.py (SYSTEM_PROMPT_OURS — multi-source
        investigation framing) and the NestBrowse/WebWeaver infer/run scripts +
        toolkit/tool files (search/visit loop shape)

  - Final cited-report prompt (buildFinalReportPrompt)
      ← WebAgent/WebWeaver/prompt/write_prompt_multi_hop_2.py
        (analytical, well-cited, takeaway-first markdown report framing)

The utility helpers stripThinking and isLowQuality, and the lightweight HTML
stripper (src/do/deep-research/text-utils.ts), were written fresh for this repo
and are NOT adapted from Tongyi DeepResearch.

