The static catalog in src/features/skills/ contains Sigilix-authored, reviewed
guidance derived from these pinned open-source skill packages:

  - OpenAI security-best-practices and security-threat-model, Apache-2.0.
  - Cloudflare workers-best-practices and durable-objects, Apache-2.0.
